      "writtenOn": "2014-02-26T21:54:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is subtle.  You don not want to default to true, as that would let a rule where nothing matched actually revoke a token.  All of the if blocks might have been skipped, and that would have the effect of creating a rule that accidentally revoked tokens.  If nothing at all matches, the rule is not applied.",
